1
00:00:38,920 --> 00:00:39,359
Stay back!

2
00:00:39,359 --> 00:00:41,240
- Look at you, Su Lin.
- Stay away from me!

3
00:00:41,359 --> 00:00:42,520
(Drain Maintenance)
A weapon? Seriously?

4
00:00:42,759 --> 00:00:43,799
Stay away from me!

5
00:00:46,159 --> 00:00:46,640
Na.

6
00:00:49,479 --> 00:00:50,719
What are you looking at? Get lost!

7
00:01:09,519 --> 00:01:10,319
Hold still!

8
00:01:10,480 --> 00:01:11,120
Let me go!

9
00:01:11,159 --> 00:01:11,760
Ting!

10
00:01:12,719 --> 00:01:13,319
Ting!

11
00:01:28,159 --> 00:01:28,640
Mom.

12
00:01:29,719 --> 00:01:30,400
Ting!

13
00:01:31,159 --> 00:01:31,599
Ting!

14
00:01:32,319 --> 00:01:33,079
Are you okay?

15
00:01:33,920 --> 00:01:35,200
Did anyone hurt you?

16
00:01:35,280 --> 00:01:35,640
I...

17
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:36,879
Where were you?

18
00:01:38,239 --> 00:01:40,480
I went to the stationery store.

19
00:01:41,239 --> 00:01:42,000
You're usually home

20
00:01:42,040 --> 00:01:42,879
by now.

21
00:01:43,719 --> 00:01:44,840
You really went there?

22
00:01:45,900 --> 00:01:46,500
What?

23
00:01:47,280 --> 00:01:47,760
Yeah.

24
00:01:49,200 --> 00:01:50,799
I even bought some pens.

25
00:01:51,359 --> 00:01:52,439
You gave me a heart attack.

26
00:01:54,079 --> 00:01:55,120
Mom.

27
00:01:55,400 --> 00:01:57,280
I was only a little late.

28
00:01:57,680 --> 00:01:58,359
Just now,

29
00:02:00,280 --> 00:02:01,040
I was upstairs.

30
00:02:02,280 --> 00:02:03,200
Over there, I saw

31
00:02:03,599 --> 00:02:04,480
a kid at your school,

32
00:02:04,480 --> 00:02:05,359
get yanked away,

33
00:02:05,599 --> 00:02:06,640
then vanish.

34
00:02:08,639 --> 00:02:09,199
It wasn't you?

35
00:02:11,800 --> 00:02:12,560
No, it wasn't.

36
00:02:17,080 --> 00:02:17,759
Are you sure?

37
00:02:17,840 --> 00:02:19,199
Yes, Mom.

38
00:02:19,400 --> 00:02:20,280
It's broad daylight.

39
00:02:20,560 --> 00:02:21,599
Don't be so paranoid.

40
00:02:21,599 --> 00:02:22,800
Why would I lie to you?

41
00:02:22,800 --> 00:02:23,919
I have no reason to.

42
00:02:24,120 --> 00:02:25,479
You have some nerve.

43
00:02:25,879 --> 00:02:26,919
Look at my hand.

44
00:02:27,039 --> 00:02:27,840
I fell while

45
00:02:28,680 --> 00:02:29,360
looking for you.

46
00:02:29,599 --> 00:02:31,280
Look what happened to me.

47
00:04:21,920 --> 00:04:25,880
=Ren Yu=

48
00:04:25,880 --> 00:04:27,880
(Adapted from Lei Mi's novel Ren Yu)

49
00:04:27,880 --> 00:04:30,840
=Episode 2=

50
00:04:31,399 --> 00:04:31,879
Honey.

51
00:04:32,120 --> 00:04:33,920
Honey, wake up. Have some water.

52
00:04:34,079 --> 00:04:34,639
Honey.

53
00:04:35,399 --> 00:04:35,959
Hey, honey.

54
00:04:36,399 --> 00:04:38,120
Honey, wake up!

55
00:04:39,199 --> 00:04:40,360
Wake up. Have some water.

56
00:04:40,360 --> 00:04:41,279
Wake up!

57
00:04:42,160 --> 00:04:43,079
That thunder!

58
00:04:43,079 --> 00:04:44,959
A storm's coming.

59
00:04:44,959 --> 00:04:46,040
Honey, wake up.

60
00:04:46,040 --> 00:04:46,920
Lin isn't home.

61
00:04:47,040 --> 00:04:48,439
Go look for her.

62
00:04:48,680 --> 00:04:49,319
Honey.

63
00:04:49,800 --> 00:04:50,399
Find...

64
00:04:52,480 --> 00:04:53,240
Find a basin.

65
00:04:54,079 --> 00:04:54,399
Su Zhe.

66
00:04:54,399 --> 00:04:55,480
Get Dad a basin, quick.

67
00:08:36,039 --> 00:08:36,679
Who is it?

68
00:08:37,159 --> 00:08:37,759
Na.

69
00:08:37,960 --> 00:08:38,559
It's me.

70
00:08:38,919 --> 00:08:39,919
You skipped dinner.

71
00:08:40,080 --> 00:08:42,519
Your dad had someone buy a cake.

72
00:08:42,720 --> 00:08:43,799
I brought you a slice.

73
00:08:43,919 --> 00:08:44,840
I don't want it.

74
00:08:45,200 --> 00:08:46,360
Call my dad right now.

75
00:08:46,440 --> 00:08:46,799
Tell him

76
00:08:46,799 --> 00:08:48,240
I'll die if he doesn't come home.

77
00:08:48,679 --> 00:08:49,080
Okay.

78
00:08:49,600 --> 00:08:50,840
I'll call him right now.

79
00:08:50,840 --> 00:08:51,679
I'll tell him.

80
00:09:11,600 --> 00:09:14,280
(Some people die, yet live on.)

81
00:09:14,280 --> 00:09:17,480
(Su Lin's Diary)
(Her last strength tells the truth.)

82
00:09:17,879 --> 00:09:18,519
Over here.

83
00:09:19,039 --> 00:09:19,960
Search every inch.

84
00:09:21,000 --> 00:09:21,480
(Marine Patrol 189)
That way.

85
00:09:21,799 --> 00:09:23,440
The area's too big to search.

86
00:09:23,960 --> 00:09:25,840
Did you see anyone else there?

87
00:09:25,879 --> 00:09:27,480
The victim appears to be female.

88
00:09:37,039 --> 00:09:37,480
Captain Wang.

89
00:09:38,279 --> 00:09:38,720
Captain Wang.

90
00:09:39,200 --> 00:09:39,960
Scene's inside.

91
00:09:40,000 --> 00:09:40,440
Okay.

92
00:09:42,080 --> 00:09:42,519
Everyone.

93
00:09:42,559 --> 00:09:43,320
Make way, please.

94
00:09:46,159 --> 00:09:47,279
What's the situation?

95
00:09:47,759 --> 00:09:49,480
Body's caught
at Weihong Canal's floodgate.

96
00:09:49,600 --> 00:09:50,600
The grate is rusted.

97
00:09:51,159 --> 00:09:52,320
It'll take time to open.

98
00:09:56,279 --> 00:09:57,279
Any ID on the victim?

99
00:09:57,480 --> 00:09:58,879
We only know she's female.

100
00:09:59,559 --> 00:10:00,200
Female?

101
00:10:03,000 --> 00:10:03,640
(Sun Hui, 31, city kindergarten teacher)

102
00:10:03,640 --> 00:10:05,480
(Missing: Aug 10, 1993)

103
00:10:05,480 --> 00:10:06,400
(Found: Aug 22, 1993)

104
00:10:07,000 --> 00:10:07,800
(Du Yuan, 33, textile institute staff)

105
00:10:07,800 --> 00:10:08,800
(Missing: Mar 16, 1993)
(Found: Apr 9, 1993)

106
00:10:11,320 --> 00:10:13,919
(All women dumped near the Weihong Canal.)

107
00:10:19,799 --> 00:10:20,240
Du.

108
00:10:21,679 --> 00:10:22,159
Captain Wang.

109
00:10:22,960 --> 00:10:24,080
Where are we?

110
00:10:24,759 --> 00:10:25,480
Almost there.

111
00:10:26,200 --> 00:10:27,000
That smell.

112
00:10:27,120 --> 00:10:29,240
Probably all the piled-up trash.

113
00:10:36,200 --> 00:10:37,360
A city inspector called.

114
00:10:37,639 --> 00:10:39,399
He checks storm drainage.

115
00:10:40,120 --> 00:10:40,759
He said

116
00:10:41,159 --> 00:10:42,559
(Weihong Canal Jane Doe Case)
everything looked normal

117
00:10:42,559 --> 00:10:43,440
at five yesterday.

118
00:10:43,480 --> 00:10:44,519
But after the storm,

119
00:10:45,080 --> 00:10:46,120
he checked Weihong Canal

120
00:10:46,519 --> 00:10:47,879
and found the body here.

121
00:10:48,440 --> 00:10:49,279
(Weihong Canal Jane Doe Case)
Reported at once.

122
00:10:50,080 --> 00:10:51,000
We've contacted

123
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:52,120
every police station in the city

124
00:10:52,480 --> 00:10:53,240
and gathered recent

125
00:10:53,240 --> 00:10:54,360
missing-person reports.

126
00:10:54,799 --> 00:10:56,200
Once we have her age,

127
00:10:56,360 --> 00:10:57,240
we'll screen them.

128
00:10:57,559 --> 00:10:59,279
Captain, there's too much trash.

129
00:10:59,399 --> 00:11:00,000
Hard to search.

130
00:11:00,200 --> 00:11:01,000
We need to hurry,

131
00:11:01,360 --> 00:11:02,159
or the body

132
00:11:02,279 --> 00:11:03,200
could wash away.

133
00:11:06,240 --> 00:11:06,679
Tai Wei.

134
00:11:06,960 --> 00:11:07,720
Be careful.

135
00:11:07,879 --> 00:11:08,879
Your trainee's good.

136
00:11:09,360 --> 00:11:10,519
With him helping recovery,

137
00:11:10,679 --> 00:11:11,919
we'll move much faster.

138
00:11:12,240 --> 00:11:12,879
Enough praise.

139
00:11:13,480 --> 00:11:14,360
He's still a rookie.

140
00:11:14,559 --> 00:11:15,000
He's green.

141
00:11:37,000 --> 00:11:38,080
Found it, Captain!

142
00:11:39,799 --> 00:11:40,919
That kid's good.

143
00:11:44,800 --> 00:11:47,320
(Weihong Canal Jane Doe Case)

144
00:11:47,480 --> 00:11:49,480
Check nearby counties and cities.

145
00:11:49,679 --> 00:11:50,080
Yes, sir.

146
00:11:51,840 --> 00:11:53,440
These are last year's two cases.

147
00:11:54,240 --> 00:11:55,279
Pull the files

148
00:11:55,679 --> 00:11:56,480
and review them.

149
00:11:57,559 --> 00:11:58,360
Case numbers.

150
00:12:00,440 --> 00:12:02,000
Take the files to Du.

151
00:12:02,799 --> 00:12:04,559
Compare every detail with the body.

152
00:12:05,080 --> 00:12:06,639
Last year's wounds

153
00:12:06,639 --> 00:12:07,399
raised questions.

154
00:12:07,759 --> 00:12:09,120
Tell Du to get us answers.

155
00:12:09,759 --> 00:12:10,200
Also,

156
00:12:10,600 --> 00:12:11,879
is the scene report ready?

157
00:12:12,879 --> 00:12:14,279
When we recovered the body,

158
00:12:14,480 --> 00:12:15,240
it was covered in silt

159
00:12:15,559 --> 00:12:16,919
(Weihong Canal Jane Doe Case)
and had extensive abrasions.

160
00:12:17,320 --> 00:12:18,799
Forensics believes

161
00:12:19,039 --> 00:12:20,960
last night's storm

162
00:12:21,159 --> 00:12:21,919
likely flushed it

163
00:12:22,000 --> 00:12:23,159
out of a storm drain

164
00:12:23,440 --> 00:12:23,960
somewhere.

165
00:12:24,279 --> 00:12:26,159
But there are drains citywide,

166
00:12:26,360 --> 00:12:27,399
(Weihong Canal Jane Doe Case)
one every 20 meters.

167
00:12:27,759 --> 00:12:28,840
This is a massive job.

168
00:12:30,360 --> 00:12:30,879
Where's Tai Wei?

169
00:12:31,399 --> 00:12:31,799
Here.

170
00:12:34,800 --> 00:12:36,960
(Underground Utility Map)

171
00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:41,159
Mei got up early

172
00:12:41,159 --> 00:12:41,919
to steam your buns.

173
00:12:43,080 --> 00:12:43,519
Here.

174
00:12:44,039 --> 00:12:44,559
Buns.

175
00:12:44,679 --> 00:12:45,320
Fried dough.

176
00:12:46,840 --> 00:12:48,279
Na, eat up.

177
00:12:48,399 --> 00:12:49,559
You skipped dinner.

178
00:12:51,440 --> 00:12:52,919
I made you a soft-fried egg.

179
00:12:53,080 --> 00:12:54,320
Sunny-side up, your favorite.

180
00:12:56,200 --> 00:12:57,080
Your bite drew blood.

181
00:12:57,080 --> 00:12:57,919
Don't touch me!

182
00:12:58,759 --> 00:12:59,480
Watch your tone.

183
00:13:00,399 --> 00:13:01,159
It's okay.

184
00:13:01,759 --> 00:13:02,240
Sit down.

185
00:13:03,000 --> 00:13:03,720
Sit down.

186
00:13:04,159 --> 00:13:04,600
Sit.

187
00:13:06,840 --> 00:13:07,879
Na's hand is bleeding.

188
00:13:08,639 --> 00:13:09,639
I'll get a bandage.

189
00:13:15,440 --> 00:13:17,240
Mei is so good to you.

190
00:13:17,240 --> 00:13:18,840
Why treat her like that?

191
00:13:20,200 --> 00:13:21,600
I don't need her concern.

192
00:13:22,399 --> 00:13:24,279
She's still your elder.

193
00:13:24,279 --> 00:13:25,720
You can't speak to her that way.

194
00:13:27,279 --> 00:13:28,200
Don't take me for a fool.

195
00:13:28,879 --> 00:13:30,360
I know what you're really saying.

196
00:13:32,639 --> 00:13:34,039
I'll say it one more time.

197
00:13:34,799 --> 00:13:36,039
I only have one mother.

198
00:13:36,480 --> 00:13:37,360
What's wrong with you?

199
00:13:39,480 --> 00:13:40,919
Now I can't even correct you?

200
00:13:58,200 --> 00:13:59,399
I was just worried.

201
00:14:01,480 --> 00:14:02,080
I was wrong.

202
00:14:04,799 --> 00:14:06,960
They've been searching since morning

203
00:14:06,960 --> 00:14:08,080
and still haven't found her.

204
00:14:08,360 --> 00:14:09,799
Don't use me as an excuse.

205
00:14:10,279 --> 00:14:11,480
This is about Han Mei.

206
00:14:13,559 --> 00:14:14,840
It really isn't.

207
00:14:17,320 --> 00:14:18,159
Of course I want

208
00:14:18,159 --> 00:14:19,720
our family to get along.

209
00:14:20,879 --> 00:14:22,080
You two are a family.

210
00:14:23,000 --> 00:14:23,720
I'm not.

211
00:14:30,840 --> 00:14:32,360
We're out of toothpaste.

212
00:14:32,879 --> 00:14:34,279
That went fast.

213
00:14:37,279 --> 00:14:38,919
You didn't even get any.

214
00:14:40,159 --> 00:14:41,159
Why sleep here?

215
00:14:51,039 --> 00:14:51,639
Honey.

216
00:14:52,279 --> 00:14:54,120
Lin never came home last night.

217
00:14:57,080 --> 00:14:58,639
She's getting out of hand.

218
00:14:58,879 --> 00:15:00,360
Now she's staying out all night.

219
00:15:01,480 --> 00:15:03,759
I searched the school last night.

220
00:15:04,120 --> 00:15:05,159
It was pouring,

221
00:15:05,159 --> 00:15:06,679
and no one was there.

222
00:15:07,399 --> 00:15:08,440
Why didn't you wake me?

223
00:15:08,600 --> 00:15:09,879
As if I could.

224
00:15:09,879 --> 00:15:11,159
You were dead drunk.

225
00:15:14,279 --> 00:15:15,240
When she gets home,

226
00:15:15,240 --> 00:15:16,159
I'll break her legs.

227
00:15:16,480 --> 00:15:17,759
She's a grown-up.

228
00:15:17,759 --> 00:15:19,320
Where could she go?

229
00:15:19,960 --> 00:15:20,679
Exactly.

230
00:15:20,720 --> 00:15:22,039
Where could she go?

231
00:15:22,440 --> 00:15:23,960
She's probably at a classmate's.

232
00:15:24,759 --> 00:15:25,679
The storm hit,

233
00:15:26,120 --> 00:15:27,240
so she stayed over.

234
00:15:27,639 --> 00:15:29,000
Call her classmates.

235
00:15:29,279 --> 00:15:30,519
She's never mentioned

236
00:15:30,519 --> 00:15:32,480
being close to anyone.

237
00:15:33,039 --> 00:15:34,679
Do I have to spell it out?

238
00:15:34,720 --> 00:15:36,399
Call her teacher.

239
00:15:36,519 --> 00:15:38,240
Do you have the teacher's number?

240
00:15:38,320 --> 00:15:39,480
I don't have one.

241
00:15:39,559 --> 00:15:40,399
Don't you usually

242
00:15:40,399 --> 00:15:41,399
handle the kids' affairs?

243
00:15:41,399 --> 00:15:43,080
Why would I have the number?

244
00:15:44,320 --> 00:15:44,919
Honey,

245
00:15:44,960 --> 00:15:46,039
how about this?

246
00:15:46,039 --> 00:15:47,279
Before work,

247
00:15:47,399 --> 00:15:48,879
go look for her,

248
00:15:48,879 --> 00:15:50,360
then head to the job site.

249
00:16:27,279 --> 00:16:27,799
Who is it?

250
00:16:28,720 --> 00:16:29,240
It's me.

251
00:16:29,440 --> 00:16:30,080
Sun Weiming.

252
00:16:44,440 --> 00:16:45,159
What brings you here?

253
00:16:47,440 --> 00:16:48,759
Didn't I call earlier

254
00:16:49,280 --> 00:16:50,400
about seeing Ting?

255
00:16:55,760 --> 00:16:56,840
Oh. Wait here.

256
00:17:16,559 --> 00:17:16,960
Morning.

257
00:17:28,279 --> 00:17:29,000
Change shoes?

258
00:17:29,079 --> 00:17:29,519
No.

259
00:17:30,160 --> 00:17:30,640
All right.

260
00:17:35,440 --> 00:17:37,039
It's exactly the same.

261
00:17:38,079 --> 00:17:39,400
Still spotless.

262
00:17:43,640 --> 00:17:45,000
Is this Ting?

263
00:17:45,680 --> 00:17:47,880
She looks taller than you now.

264
00:17:48,680 --> 00:17:49,079
From me.

265
00:17:51,640 --> 00:17:52,039
Well...

266
00:17:54,079 --> 00:17:54,440
Here.

267
00:17:54,599 --> 00:17:56,000
I brought these for you two.

268
00:17:58,039 --> 00:17:58,720
Animal crackers.

269
00:17:58,960 --> 00:18:00,240
I hear kids love them.

270
00:18:02,000 --> 00:18:02,599
This is nice.

271
00:18:03,119 --> 00:18:03,759
From Beijing.

272
00:18:06,960 --> 00:18:07,279
This.

273
00:18:07,720 --> 00:18:08,839
A Walkman.

274
00:18:09,359 --> 00:18:10,480
I bought it for Ting.

275
00:18:23,000 --> 00:18:24,039
It's getting late.

276
00:18:25,799 --> 00:18:27,519
Isn't it time for her to get up?

277
00:18:28,000 --> 00:18:29,160
I'll go wake her up.

278
00:18:30,200 --> 00:18:30,640
No.

279
00:18:32,799 --> 00:18:33,359
She's grown.

280
00:18:33,960 --> 00:18:34,839
It'd be improper.

281
00:18:35,680 --> 00:18:36,880
- I'll go.
- Okay.

282
00:18:39,480 --> 00:18:40,039
Ting.

283
00:19:21,160 --> 00:19:21,839
(Stay back!)

284
00:19:22,480 --> 00:19:23,039
(Stay back!)

285
00:19:23,559 --> 00:19:24,279
(Stay away!)

286
00:19:24,680 --> 00:19:25,440
(Drain Maintenance)
(Stay back!)

287
00:19:26,160 --> 00:19:27,000
(Please Detour)
(Stay back!)

288
00:19:27,480 --> 00:19:28,359
(Stay away!)

289
00:20:16,960 --> 00:20:18,119
Why call the police?

290
00:20:18,119 --> 00:20:19,200
Look around.

291
00:20:19,200 --> 00:20:20,119
The door's intact.

292
00:20:20,160 --> 00:20:20,920
Windows, too.

293
00:20:20,960 --> 00:20:21,960
Even if someone broke in,

294
00:20:22,039 --> 00:20:22,920
wouldn't she scream?

295
00:20:23,079 --> 00:20:23,720
You're an adult.

296
00:20:23,720 --> 00:20:24,720
Wouldn't you notice?

297
00:20:24,920 --> 00:20:26,480
Mom, who is it?

298
00:20:38,079 --> 00:20:39,079
Ting.

299
00:20:40,960 --> 00:20:41,319
Dad.

300
00:20:44,520 --> 00:20:45,360
Hey.

301
00:20:47,119 --> 00:20:48,880
Ting. Are you okay?

302
00:20:53,240 --> 00:20:53,720
Mom.

303
00:20:56,160 --> 00:20:57,799
I was studying downstairs.

304
00:20:58,640 --> 00:20:59,319
Forgot to tell you.

305
00:20:59,559 --> 00:21:01,599
Can't you tell me beforehand?

306
00:21:01,599 --> 00:21:01,920
Jiang Yushu.

307
00:21:01,920 --> 00:21:03,759
- Trying to kill me?
- Jiang Yushu!

308
00:21:03,880 --> 00:21:04,960
You're too wound up.

309
00:21:04,960 --> 00:21:05,920
She's growing up.

310
00:21:06,279 --> 00:21:07,759
You're overprotecting her.

311
00:21:07,960 --> 00:21:09,079
You'll scare her.

312
00:21:13,240 --> 00:21:13,680
Mr. Ma.

313
00:21:14,000 --> 00:21:15,559
I searched that drain.

314
00:21:15,759 --> 00:21:17,160
No sign of your daughter's dog.

315
00:21:17,400 --> 00:21:18,000
That's impossible.

316
00:21:18,640 --> 00:21:19,960
She fell into the sewer.

317
00:21:19,960 --> 00:21:20,599
You found nothing?

318
00:21:20,599 --> 00:21:21,920
Did you search carefully?

319
00:21:24,079 --> 00:21:26,480
Have you searched every pipe

320
00:21:26,839 --> 00:21:27,440
nearby?

321
00:21:27,960 --> 00:21:29,519
I went everywhere I could.

322
00:21:29,839 --> 00:21:31,640
But the sewer network is complex,

323
00:21:31,920 --> 00:21:33,319
and last night's storm

324
00:21:33,559 --> 00:21:35,039
flooded the deeper pipes.

325
00:21:35,400 --> 00:21:36,839
We can't search any farther.

326
00:21:37,480 --> 00:21:38,319
Besides...

327
00:21:38,880 --> 00:21:39,319
Say it.

328
00:21:40,000 --> 00:21:41,400
The dog fell in before the storm.

329
00:21:41,400 --> 00:21:42,400
Then the rain hit.

330
00:21:43,000 --> 00:21:45,279
The current would've been fierce.

331
00:21:45,359 --> 00:21:46,359
Not just a dog.

332
00:21:46,640 --> 00:21:47,680
Even a person

333
00:21:47,960 --> 00:21:49,400
could easily be swept away.

334
00:21:49,920 --> 00:21:50,880
If no one's found her

335
00:21:50,880 --> 00:21:52,200
by now,

336
00:21:53,480 --> 00:21:54,640
she probably didn't make it.

337
00:22:16,559 --> 00:22:17,319
Su Lin!

338
00:22:18,480 --> 00:22:18,920
Su Lin!

339
00:22:20,200 --> 00:22:20,839
Su Lin!

340
00:22:21,200 --> 00:22:22,440
Say something, Su Lin!

341
00:22:23,960 --> 00:22:24,519
Nothing.

342
00:22:25,279 --> 00:22:26,480
Could she be dead?

343
00:22:31,279 --> 00:22:31,960
Su Lin!

344
00:22:32,559 --> 00:22:33,559
Quit playing dead!

345
00:22:34,160 --> 00:22:35,359
Maybe I should go down and check it.

346
00:22:35,599 --> 00:22:36,279
Why bother?

347
00:22:36,920 --> 00:22:38,240
There's a ladder. She can climb it.

348
00:22:38,440 --> 00:22:38,960
Exactly.

349
00:22:39,279 --> 00:22:40,119
No answer. Won't come up.

350
00:22:40,119 --> 00:22:40,920
It's on purpose.

351
00:22:41,319 --> 00:22:42,319
She's hiding to scare us.

352
00:22:44,000 --> 00:22:45,319
What a nasty liar.

353
00:22:45,720 --> 00:22:47,039
She nearly scared me to death.

354
00:22:48,039 --> 00:22:50,079
(Su Lin, you're trying to scare us.)

355
00:22:51,599 --> 00:22:53,920
(I just knew it.)

356
00:22:54,880 --> 00:22:56,480
(Chaobei Police Bureau)
I just went to City Planning.

357
00:22:56,559 --> 00:22:58,680
This is the city's utility map.

358
00:22:58,759 --> 00:22:59,799
It's extremely complex.

359
00:23:00,000 --> 00:23:01,039
This map alone

360
00:23:01,119 --> 00:23:02,880
can't locate the original dump site.

361
00:23:03,359 --> 00:23:04,799
We must factor in rainfall,

362
00:23:05,000 --> 00:23:06,880
flow direction, and speed.

363
00:23:07,599 --> 00:23:09,599
(Chaobei Underground Utility Map)
I request approval

364
00:23:09,680 --> 00:23:11,119
to have City Planning staff

365
00:23:11,160 --> 00:23:12,720
help us search underground.

366
00:23:17,759 --> 00:23:19,359
Our sewer system

367
00:23:19,720 --> 00:23:21,319
has complicated terrain.

368
00:23:22,599 --> 00:23:23,799
Everyone, stay safe.

369
00:23:24,599 --> 00:23:25,480
Keep your eyes open.

370
00:23:25,759 --> 00:23:27,160
Don't miss a single clue.

371
00:23:28,839 --> 00:23:29,400
Everyone else,

372
00:23:29,880 --> 00:23:31,519
identify the victim.

373
00:23:32,319 --> 00:23:33,079
Yes, sir.

374
00:23:33,680 --> 00:23:35,480
How would I know about that?

375
00:23:35,680 --> 00:23:36,960
I have a construction project

376
00:23:37,359 --> 00:23:38,680
with groundwater trouble.

377
00:23:38,839 --> 00:23:39,640
That's why I asked.

378
00:23:40,200 --> 00:23:41,000
Hey,

379
00:23:41,200 --> 00:23:42,279
Director Yang.

380
00:23:43,440 --> 00:23:45,240
What's going on with that murder?

381
00:23:45,319 --> 00:23:46,240
Can you give me some details?

382
00:23:49,200 --> 00:23:49,640
Sure.

383
00:23:50,240 --> 00:23:51,480
Dinner's on me next time.

384
00:23:53,400 --> 00:23:54,160
What's going on?

385
00:23:55,039 --> 00:23:56,039
Su Lin might...

386
00:23:56,160 --> 00:23:57,240
What happened to her?

387
00:24:00,680 --> 00:24:01,480
Su Lin is fine.

388
00:24:02,319 --> 00:24:03,599
My men went to her home.

389
00:24:03,720 --> 00:24:05,160
She bought breakfast this morning.

390
00:24:05,279 --> 00:24:06,839
She had a few scrapes.

391
00:24:07,720 --> 00:24:08,359
Really?

392
00:24:08,880 --> 00:24:09,279
It's true.

393
00:24:09,880 --> 00:24:11,319
Why isn't Na at school yet?

394
00:24:11,359 --> 00:24:11,759
Go to school.

395
00:24:11,960 --> 00:24:12,319
Now.

396
00:24:12,319 --> 00:24:12,640
Your bag.

397
00:24:13,000 --> 00:24:13,480
It's okay.

398
00:24:13,519 --> 00:24:15,319
This is all behind us now.

399
00:24:16,799 --> 00:24:17,960
I don't want to go today.

400
00:24:20,000 --> 00:24:20,920
I understand.

401
00:24:21,440 --> 00:24:22,720
After all that,

402
00:24:22,720 --> 00:24:23,599
you got scared

403
00:24:23,680 --> 00:24:24,279
and tired.

404
00:24:24,279 --> 00:24:24,759
Right?

405
00:24:25,039 --> 00:24:25,960
But think about it.

406
00:24:26,319 --> 00:24:27,839
If you skip school today,

407
00:24:28,400 --> 00:24:29,759
Su Lin might stay home, too.

408
00:24:30,160 --> 00:24:31,000
If both of you are absent,

409
00:24:31,119 --> 00:24:31,680
that looks bad.

410
00:24:32,279 --> 00:24:33,359
And if Su Lin goes to school,

411
00:24:33,799 --> 00:24:34,400
but you don't,

412
00:24:35,240 --> 00:24:36,440
she'll think

413
00:24:37,039 --> 00:24:38,960
you're scared after yesterday.

414
00:24:39,319 --> 00:24:40,079
She better not.

415
00:24:40,640 --> 00:24:41,160
Exactly.

416
00:24:41,759 --> 00:24:42,240
Don't worry.

417
00:24:43,000 --> 00:24:43,359
Come on.

418
00:24:43,599 --> 00:24:44,680
Go on to school.

419
00:24:47,079 --> 00:24:47,759
- I'm off.
- Go.

420
00:24:48,240 --> 00:24:48,759
- Mm.
- Careful.

421
00:25:11,359 --> 00:25:12,200
What did he say?

422
00:25:16,039 --> 00:25:17,559
Su Lin might actually be

423
00:25:18,559 --> 00:25:19,119
dead.

424
00:25:20,440 --> 00:25:21,400
Dead?

425
00:25:24,119 --> 00:25:24,640
Dead.

426
00:25:24,960 --> 00:25:25,359
How...

427
00:25:26,359 --> 00:25:27,720
How could she just die?

428
00:25:28,400 --> 00:25:29,920
They found a woman's body

429
00:25:30,880 --> 00:25:32,599
in Weihong Canal today.

430
00:25:34,359 --> 00:25:37,680
That's far from the towel factory.

431
00:25:39,799 --> 00:25:41,799
The city's sewers empty into

432
00:25:42,799 --> 00:25:43,720
Litong River

433
00:25:43,720 --> 00:25:45,240
and several major canals,

434
00:25:45,240 --> 00:25:46,599
including Weihong Canal.

435
00:25:47,599 --> 00:25:49,799
Police visited Yang's office today.

436
00:25:51,200 --> 00:25:52,160
They said the body

437
00:25:52,319 --> 00:25:53,920
may have been flushed

438
00:25:55,160 --> 00:25:56,440
through the sewer system.

439
00:25:59,400 --> 00:26:00,119
Is it confirmed?

440
00:26:01,200 --> 00:26:02,680
Was the body Su Lin's?

441
00:26:02,960 --> 00:26:03,799
He didn't say.

442
00:26:06,160 --> 00:26:08,079
It was recovered this morning.

443
00:26:08,960 --> 00:26:11,039
Director Yang didn't know any more.

444
00:26:11,119 --> 00:26:11,759
Then hurry.

445
00:26:11,920 --> 00:26:13,920
Ask around at the police bureau.

446
00:26:15,079 --> 00:26:16,079
Now?

447
00:26:16,480 --> 00:26:17,599
Na pushed her

448
00:26:17,599 --> 00:26:18,599
into the sewer yesterday.

449
00:26:18,640 --> 00:26:19,759
Today she's missing,

450
00:26:20,279 --> 00:26:21,279
and a woman's body

451
00:26:21,279 --> 00:26:22,319
reaches Weihong Canal.

452
00:26:22,559 --> 00:26:23,720
If we ask around now,

453
00:26:23,960 --> 00:26:24,319
it's

454
00:26:24,920 --> 00:26:26,400
practically a confession.

455
00:26:28,720 --> 00:26:30,480
But we can't hide this.

456
00:26:32,000 --> 00:26:32,480
Dongchen.

457
00:26:33,559 --> 00:26:34,039
Maybe

458
00:26:34,839 --> 00:26:36,519
we should take Na to confess.

459
00:26:37,480 --> 00:26:38,400
Are you crazy?

460
00:26:38,680 --> 00:26:40,720
That's better than an arrest.

461
00:26:41,839 --> 00:26:43,319
Na didn't mean to do it.

462
00:26:43,559 --> 00:26:44,039
Think about it.

463
00:26:44,079 --> 00:26:44,799
She didn't mean it.

464
00:26:44,799 --> 00:26:45,920
The push was an accident.

465
00:26:46,079 --> 00:26:46,920
If we explain it now,

466
00:26:46,920 --> 00:26:48,039
they'll understand.

467
00:26:48,079 --> 00:26:48,920
You think so?

468
00:26:49,000 --> 00:26:50,000
A girl still died!

469
00:26:52,400 --> 00:26:53,720
Absolutely not.

470
00:26:56,960 --> 00:26:58,599
Na's life has barely begun.

471
00:27:00,519 --> 00:27:02,160
If she's caught up in this,

472
00:27:04,920 --> 00:27:06,680
her whole life will be ruined.

473
00:27:10,119 --> 00:27:11,759
What can we do now?

474
00:27:12,440 --> 00:27:13,799
When her family sees she's gone,

475
00:27:13,839 --> 00:27:15,119
they'll call the police.

476
00:27:15,799 --> 00:27:16,599
Right now,

477
00:27:16,720 --> 00:27:18,160
the police haven't linked it to us.

478
00:27:18,799 --> 00:27:19,839
Once they investigate,

479
00:27:20,039 --> 00:27:21,559
they'll find Na.

480
00:27:22,920 --> 00:27:24,559
We can't cover this up.

481
00:27:30,759 --> 00:27:32,079
Then stop them from calling.

482
00:27:33,759 --> 00:27:35,079
If I miss the morning shift,

483
00:27:35,319 --> 00:27:36,480
I might lose

484
00:27:36,480 --> 00:27:37,720
my entire day's pay.

485
00:27:38,640 --> 00:27:41,079
What do you do

486
00:27:41,160 --> 00:27:41,960
at home all day?

487
00:27:44,400 --> 00:27:46,240
You don't even know where our child is.

488
00:27:47,079 --> 00:27:48,759
You don't have her teacher's number.

489
00:27:49,279 --> 00:27:51,079
You don't even buy the toothpaste.

490
00:27:53,920 --> 00:27:54,960
It must be Lin!

491
00:27:55,359 --> 00:27:56,160
Don't hit her.

492
00:27:56,160 --> 00:27:56,720
Go on.

493
00:27:58,759 --> 00:27:59,200
Hello.

494
00:28:01,400 --> 00:28:02,920
Who are you looking for?

495
00:28:03,400 --> 00:28:04,880
Is this Su Weiguo's home?

496
00:28:07,759 --> 00:28:08,720
Captain Li.

497
00:28:13,480 --> 00:28:14,480
What brings you here?

498
00:28:14,880 --> 00:28:16,519
I was about to head to the job site.

499
00:28:16,799 --> 00:28:18,119
The job site can wait.

500
00:28:19,720 --> 00:28:20,400
Please, come in.

501
00:28:24,960 --> 00:28:25,839
Let me introduce you.

502
00:28:28,119 --> 00:28:28,680
This is

503
00:28:29,119 --> 00:28:29,680
Mr. Ma.

504
00:28:31,319 --> 00:28:31,839
Oh, my!

505
00:28:31,880 --> 00:28:32,599
I'm so sorry.

506
00:28:32,720 --> 00:28:33,759
It's fine.

507
00:28:34,119 --> 00:28:34,640
Ma'am.

508
00:28:35,160 --> 00:28:35,880
Don't fuss.

509
00:28:36,279 --> 00:28:37,039
Let's talk.

510
00:28:37,119 --> 00:28:38,160
Of course.

511
00:28:40,480 --> 00:28:41,519
Oh, forget this.

512
00:28:42,680 --> 00:28:43,440
Have some water.

513
00:28:44,759 --> 00:28:45,319
Su.

514
00:28:45,880 --> 00:28:46,400
Sit down.

515
00:28:47,319 --> 00:28:48,519
Let me remove the dishes.

516
00:28:52,640 --> 00:28:53,319
Su.

517
00:28:54,119 --> 00:28:55,519
You're a lucky man.

518
00:28:57,000 --> 00:28:58,799
If Mr. Ma hadn't mentioned it,

519
00:28:58,960 --> 00:29:00,319
I wouldn't know Su Lin

520
00:29:00,599 --> 00:29:01,640
and Mr. Ma's daughter

521
00:29:01,680 --> 00:29:02,720
attend the same school.

522
00:29:03,079 --> 00:29:04,559
They're even classmates.

523
00:29:04,859 --> 00:29:05,559
Oh?

524
00:29:07,200 --> 00:29:07,640
Well.

525
00:29:12,599 --> 00:29:14,079
Did Su Lin

526
00:29:14,359 --> 00:29:16,160
cause trouble at school?

527
00:29:17,160 --> 00:29:17,680
No.

528
00:29:18,759 --> 00:29:19,279
Well.

529
00:29:19,680 --> 00:29:21,000
Yesterday,

530
00:29:21,519 --> 00:29:23,359
Su Lin and Ma Na

531
00:29:23,400 --> 00:29:25,480
had a small disagreement.

532
00:29:26,880 --> 00:29:29,359
Then I apologize for Su Lin.

533
00:29:29,480 --> 00:29:31,400
If she offended your daughter,

534
00:29:32,759 --> 00:29:34,440
please forgive her.

535
00:29:36,519 --> 00:29:37,119
Su.

536
00:29:37,759 --> 00:29:38,920
You don't need to make apologies.

537
00:29:39,839 --> 00:29:42,119
And I think you've got it wrong.

538
00:29:43,680 --> 00:29:44,920
I know

539
00:29:45,000 --> 00:29:46,000
my daughter very well.

540
00:29:46,640 --> 00:29:47,920
She's never known hardship

541
00:29:48,240 --> 00:29:49,480
and can be headstrong.

542
00:29:50,039 --> 00:29:51,400
If she and Su Lin

543
00:29:51,480 --> 00:29:52,480
had a disagreement,

544
00:29:52,960 --> 00:29:54,319
then most likely,

545
00:29:55,119 --> 00:29:56,359
my daughter was at fault.

546
00:29:57,279 --> 00:29:58,160
That's why

547
00:29:58,920 --> 00:30:01,559
I asked Li to come with me.

548
00:30:02,039 --> 00:30:03,079
First,

549
00:30:03,480 --> 00:30:07,319
I want to apologize for my daughter.

550
00:30:08,079 --> 00:30:09,240
After all,

551
00:30:09,279 --> 00:30:10,160
they're classmates.

552
00:30:10,599 --> 00:30:12,319
This shouldn't hurt their friendship.

553
00:30:12,839 --> 00:30:13,920
That's a relief.

554
00:30:13,920 --> 00:30:15,079
I mean it.

555
00:30:16,240 --> 00:30:17,480
Kids have disagreements.

556
00:30:17,559 --> 00:30:18,480
It's no big deal.

557
00:30:18,599 --> 00:30:19,240
Right?

558
00:30:19,960 --> 00:30:20,599
Besides,

559
00:30:20,880 --> 00:30:22,680
we don't know who was wrong.

560
00:30:22,680 --> 00:30:25,000
What was the disagreement about?

561
00:30:26,119 --> 00:30:26,880
As for the details,

562
00:30:26,880 --> 00:30:28,000
I honestly don't know.

563
00:30:33,759 --> 00:30:34,559
Is Su Lin home?

564
00:30:34,880 --> 00:30:36,200
I forgot to close the window.

565
00:30:36,519 --> 00:30:37,319
No, she's not.

566
00:30:38,119 --> 00:30:38,960
Probably the wind.

567
00:30:39,560 --> 00:30:40,160
Oh.

568
00:30:42,759 --> 00:30:43,279
Well.

569
00:30:44,160 --> 00:30:45,640
Make sure the window is closed.

570
00:30:45,799 --> 00:30:46,920
I'm on it.

571
00:31:29,319 --> 00:31:30,519
Do you have

572
00:31:30,799 --> 00:31:33,119
the teacher's contact information?

573
00:31:34,960 --> 00:31:35,759
Actually, no.

574
00:31:36,200 --> 00:31:36,799
Something wrong?

575
00:31:39,200 --> 00:31:41,640
Su Lin didn't come home last night.

576
00:31:42,400 --> 00:31:43,200
We thought

577
00:31:43,359 --> 00:31:45,440
we'd call her teacher

578
00:31:45,759 --> 00:31:47,480
and ask about yesterday.

579
00:31:47,880 --> 00:31:49,759
Maybe she stayed with a classmate.

580
00:31:51,119 --> 00:31:52,039
She was gone all night?

581
00:31:52,039 --> 00:31:53,039
Yes.

582
00:31:58,559 --> 00:32:00,720
Could she still be mad at Na?

583
00:32:01,400 --> 00:32:02,880
Teenagers

584
00:32:03,079 --> 00:32:04,400
can be sensitive and rebellious.

585
00:32:05,359 --> 00:32:07,160
Running away in anger

586
00:32:07,480 --> 00:32:08,440
isn't unusual.

587
00:32:10,480 --> 00:32:11,680
Didn't you ask

588
00:32:11,880 --> 00:32:13,440
her friends or classmates?

589
00:32:14,440 --> 00:32:15,119
Not yet.

590
00:32:15,319 --> 00:32:17,440
I went to bed too early last night.

591
00:32:17,799 --> 00:32:18,599
Her mother

592
00:32:19,000 --> 00:32:20,240
has neither the teacher's

593
00:32:20,279 --> 00:32:21,920
nor her classmates' numbers.

594
00:32:22,400 --> 00:32:25,279
We haven't called anyone yet.

595
00:32:28,240 --> 00:32:29,559
This is my fault.

596
00:32:30,759 --> 00:32:31,200
Listen.

597
00:32:32,160 --> 00:32:33,599
Since my daughter was at fault,

598
00:32:34,200 --> 00:32:35,960
leave it to me.

599
00:32:36,319 --> 00:32:36,720
All right?

600
00:32:37,720 --> 00:32:39,799
Don't contact the school or students.

601
00:32:39,839 --> 00:32:40,599
I'll handle it.

602
00:32:40,960 --> 00:32:42,799
We can't trouble you with this.

603
00:32:43,039 --> 00:32:43,839
It's no trouble.

604
00:32:43,920 --> 00:32:44,920
Give me a chance

605
00:32:45,000 --> 00:32:46,160
to make amends.

606
00:32:46,559 --> 00:32:47,559
If I don't do this,

607
00:32:47,799 --> 00:32:48,720
I can't go home

608
00:32:48,720 --> 00:32:50,160
and face Na.

609
00:32:51,079 --> 00:32:53,119
Honey, we should find her ourselves.

610
00:32:53,160 --> 00:32:55,440
Let's not trouble Mr. Ma.

611
00:32:55,519 --> 00:32:56,039
Ma'am.

612
00:32:56,839 --> 00:32:57,640
You may not

613
00:32:57,799 --> 00:32:59,480
understand Mr. Ma's standing.

614
00:33:00,000 --> 00:33:00,960
If he makes a promise,

615
00:33:01,279 --> 00:33:02,640
he'll find her for sure.

616
00:33:03,400 --> 00:33:04,720
If we go searching,

617
00:33:04,920 --> 00:33:05,640
we'll interfere.

618
00:33:06,400 --> 00:33:07,240
More importantly,

619
00:33:07,240 --> 00:33:09,240
that project you recently took on

620
00:33:09,680 --> 00:33:11,200
has a tight deadline.

621
00:33:11,759 --> 00:33:12,680
Don't delay it.

622
00:33:13,480 --> 00:33:14,279
Rest assured.

623
00:33:14,559 --> 00:33:16,079
The project won't fall behind.

624
00:33:17,599 --> 00:33:18,000
Good.

625
00:33:19,319 --> 00:33:20,359
Then it's settled.

626
00:33:20,640 --> 00:33:22,400
Leave it to me.

627
00:33:22,640 --> 00:33:23,039
Okay?

628
00:33:23,160 --> 00:33:25,279
I'll do everything I can.

629
00:33:27,559 --> 00:33:28,519
With Mr. Ma's help,

630
00:33:28,599 --> 00:33:29,279
what could we

631
00:33:29,279 --> 00:33:30,440
possibly worry about?

632
00:33:30,799 --> 00:33:31,240
Right?

633
00:33:31,720 --> 00:33:32,240
Then,

634
00:33:32,680 --> 00:33:33,640
when she comes home,

635
00:33:34,079 --> 00:33:35,359
I'll bring her here

636
00:33:35,720 --> 00:33:37,400
to apologize in person.

637
00:33:40,200 --> 00:33:40,720
Captain.

638
00:33:42,119 --> 00:33:43,680
I got the April-to-August forecasts

639
00:33:43,759 --> 00:33:44,559
you asked for.

640
00:33:45,079 --> 00:33:46,440
As for the floodgate grate,

641
00:33:46,599 --> 00:33:47,240
Planning says

642
00:33:47,240 --> 00:33:48,279
it was installed last November.

643
00:33:48,880 --> 00:33:49,200
Good.

644
00:33:53,000 --> 00:33:54,440
I wasn't at the bureau last year,

645
00:33:54,680 --> 00:33:55,680
but I heard of a case...

646
00:33:55,680 --> 00:33:56,599
That's groundless.

647
00:33:57,440 --> 00:33:58,079
Don't gossip.

648
00:34:00,039 --> 00:34:00,680
Wang.

649
00:34:01,279 --> 00:34:01,759
What?

650
00:34:02,240 --> 00:34:02,880
Got a lead?

651
00:34:03,440 --> 00:34:04,160
What's the rush?

652
00:34:04,519 --> 00:34:04,839
Here.

653
00:34:06,079 --> 00:34:06,759
Sign these

654
00:34:06,759 --> 00:34:07,880
you assigned me.

655
00:34:09,119 --> 00:34:10,519
I should've had results by now.

656
00:34:11,000 --> 00:34:12,840
The workload slowed me down.

657
00:34:13,079 --> 00:34:14,519
Come on. Quit kidding around.

658
00:34:16,719 --> 00:34:18,039
If you had no lead,

659
00:34:18,480 --> 00:34:19,719
would you leave that room?

660
00:34:21,679 --> 00:34:22,719
You got me.

661
00:34:23,119 --> 00:34:23,559
Here.

662
00:34:24,599 --> 00:34:25,039
I'm off.

663
00:34:28,320 --> 00:34:29,000
We have her age.

664
00:34:30,239 --> 00:34:31,360
Identify her at once.

665
00:34:33,440 --> 00:34:34,920
Eighteen to twenty.

666
00:34:35,599 --> 00:34:36,320
Barely an adult.

667
00:35:50,800 --> 00:35:52,320
(Chaobei Underground Utility Map)

668
00:36:15,679 --> 00:36:16,320
Captain.

669
00:36:19,679 --> 00:36:20,679
You finally showed up.

670
00:36:21,159 --> 00:36:22,480
What took so long?

671
00:36:23,039 --> 00:36:24,559
You said decomposition

672
00:36:24,760 --> 00:36:26,159
made her face unrecognizable.

673
00:36:26,400 --> 00:36:27,440
So I cast a wider net

674
00:36:27,599 --> 00:36:29,519
and checked the nearby counties.

675
00:36:29,800 --> 00:36:31,719
Cut the chatter. What did you find?

676
00:36:32,239 --> 00:36:34,360
Seven missing women

677
00:36:34,400 --> 00:36:35,280
match her age

678
00:36:35,280 --> 00:36:36,000
and build.

679
00:36:36,320 --> 00:36:37,840
Arrange identification at once.

680
00:36:53,599 --> 00:36:54,519
What happened?

681
00:36:56,559 --> 00:36:57,320
Let me.

682
00:36:57,400 --> 00:36:58,360
I twisted my arm.

683
00:36:58,679 --> 00:36:59,519
Good it's my left.

684
00:37:01,119 --> 00:37:01,719
I'll rest it.

685
00:37:02,199 --> 00:37:03,400
I can work tomorrow.

686
00:37:04,079 --> 00:37:05,440
What's going on lately?

687
00:37:05,480 --> 00:37:07,079
You come home late every night.

688
00:37:08,239 --> 00:37:09,599
The foreman gave me extra work.

689
00:37:10,880 --> 00:37:12,280
At least I'll earn more.

690
00:37:14,039 --> 00:37:15,000
Is Lin home?

691
00:37:15,239 --> 00:37:16,480
No.

692
00:37:20,559 --> 00:37:21,679
Has Mr. Ma

693
00:37:21,679 --> 00:37:23,199
heard anything at all?

694
00:37:24,239 --> 00:37:24,639
No.

695
00:37:25,760 --> 00:37:27,119
Honey, take two days off

696
00:37:27,119 --> 00:37:28,000
and get some rest.

697
00:37:28,639 --> 00:37:30,679
You can look for Lin, too.

698
00:37:31,440 --> 00:37:32,280
Easy for you to say.

699
00:37:32,360 --> 00:37:33,559
I need this job.

700
00:37:33,880 --> 00:37:35,119
The moment I leave,

701
00:37:35,360 --> 00:37:36,880
they'll replace me.

702
00:37:37,719 --> 00:37:39,400
It's been two days.

703
00:37:39,639 --> 00:37:41,519
We haven't heard a thing.

704
00:37:41,760 --> 00:37:42,159
If

705
00:37:42,360 --> 00:37:43,880
she is gone for two days,

706
00:37:43,960 --> 00:37:46,039
she's officially missing.

707
00:37:49,639 --> 00:37:51,000
They keep you late every night.

708
00:37:51,280 --> 00:37:52,599
Is that intentional?

709
00:37:57,760 --> 00:37:58,360
Could

710
00:37:58,599 --> 00:38:00,840
Mr. Ma's daughter have hurt Lin?

711
00:38:02,280 --> 00:38:04,119
Honey, let's call the police.

712
00:38:05,280 --> 00:38:05,840
Right.

713
00:38:06,280 --> 00:38:06,760
Call the police.

714
00:38:07,239 --> 00:38:07,719
Okay.

715
00:38:08,280 --> 00:38:09,360
I'll make the call now.

716
00:38:19,780 --> 00:38:21,480
Su, you're already home.

717
00:38:22,400 --> 00:38:23,320
Mr. Ma.

718
00:38:32,320 --> 00:38:33,400
Let's have a drink.

719
00:38:34,960 --> 00:38:35,760
Mr. Ma.

720
00:38:36,079 --> 00:38:37,920
Any news about Lin?

721
00:38:38,239 --> 00:38:39,079
Don't worry.

722
00:38:39,199 --> 00:38:40,039
We've been searching.

723
00:38:40,280 --> 00:38:41,800
You'll be the first to know.

724
00:38:42,719 --> 00:38:44,000
So you haven't found her.

725
00:38:45,960 --> 00:38:46,559
Su.

726
00:38:47,320 --> 00:38:49,199
Chaobei's a decent-sized city.

727
00:38:49,559 --> 00:38:50,519
She's a grown girl

728
00:38:50,719 --> 00:38:51,639
who can go anywhere.

729
00:38:52,000 --> 00:38:54,039
This search isn't as easy as you think.

730
00:38:55,159 --> 00:38:56,199
Give me two more days.

731
00:38:56,280 --> 00:38:57,559
Let's not discuss it today.

732
00:38:58,199 --> 00:38:59,519
Let's have a drink.

733
00:39:01,559 --> 00:39:03,679
What if there's no news in two days?

734
00:39:18,000 --> 00:39:18,559
Call the police.

735
00:39:22,360 --> 00:39:23,199
Call the police!

736
00:39:24,079 --> 00:39:24,519
Okay.

737
00:39:25,039 --> 00:39:25,559
Ma'am.

738
00:39:28,000 --> 00:39:29,639
Let's not bother the police,

739
00:39:29,639 --> 00:39:30,239
all right?

740
00:39:30,599 --> 00:39:31,639
They're so busy.

741
00:39:31,719 --> 00:39:33,360
Can they find her faster than I can?

742
00:39:34,079 --> 00:39:34,880
You're faster?

743
00:39:35,239 --> 00:39:37,440
Then where is Lin now?

744
00:39:39,320 --> 00:39:40,000
Two days.

745
00:39:40,360 --> 00:39:42,199
Give me two more days, okay?

746
00:39:42,719 --> 00:39:43,719
Once you call the police,

747
00:39:43,719 --> 00:39:45,000
you'll drag everyone into this.

748
00:39:45,320 --> 00:39:45,960
Right?

749
00:39:47,199 --> 00:39:48,400
I'm injured anyway.

750
00:39:48,400 --> 00:39:49,119
I'll take two days off.

751
00:39:50,440 --> 00:39:51,639
We'll call the police.

752
00:39:51,840 --> 00:39:52,639
You keep searching.

753
00:39:53,039 --> 00:39:53,960
We can do both.

754
00:39:55,159 --> 00:39:55,840
Su.

755
00:39:56,519 --> 00:39:57,159
Honey.

756
00:40:06,199 --> 00:40:08,280
Why are you so afraid of the police?

757
00:40:09,679 --> 00:40:10,679
Did your daughter

758
00:40:10,719 --> 00:40:12,760
do something to Lin?

759
00:40:13,679 --> 00:40:14,840
What could she have done?

760
00:40:14,840 --> 00:40:15,880
I keep telling you.

761
00:40:15,880 --> 00:40:17,880
They were just messing around.

762
00:40:18,400 --> 00:40:19,480
What else could happen?

763
00:40:24,960 --> 00:40:25,800
Call the police. Now.

764
00:40:25,800 --> 00:40:26,440
Okay.

765
00:40:29,000 --> 00:40:30,400
Let go!

766
00:40:31,840 --> 00:40:32,880
Hello, police?

767
00:40:34,400 --> 00:40:35,480
I need to file a report.

768
00:40:35,719 --> 00:40:37,239
Hello? Hello?

769
00:40:37,360 --> 00:40:39,559
Hear me out!

770
00:40:39,960 --> 00:40:41,480
Give me the cord!

771
00:40:41,840 --> 00:40:43,840
Hear me out!

772
00:40:44,000 --> 00:40:45,519
Give it back!

773
00:40:49,159 --> 00:40:50,239
Mom, Dad, what's wrong?

774
00:40:59,600 --> 00:41:01,800
=Ren Yu=
(Next Time...)

775
00:41:03,039 --> 00:41:04,360
Su Lin missed class today.

776
00:41:04,599 --> 00:41:05,880
Did something happen?

777
00:41:05,880 --> 00:41:07,000
What could've happened?

778
00:41:07,480 --> 00:41:09,280
Two girls their age

779
00:41:09,280 --> 00:41:10,400
had a disagreement.

780
00:41:10,719 --> 00:41:11,920
What could happen?

781
00:41:12,360 --> 00:41:13,039
What else?

782
00:41:13,039 --> 00:41:14,679
You think my girl killed yours?

783
00:41:18,800 --> 00:41:19,280
What are you looking at?

784
00:41:19,280 --> 00:41:20,159
Get lost!

785
00:41:20,400 --> 00:41:21,280
Where is Su Lin?

786
00:41:21,800 --> 00:41:23,000
Mind your own business.

787
00:41:24,360 --> 00:41:25,880
Anyone with information,

788
00:41:26,079 --> 00:41:28,880
or whose loved one is out of touch,

789
00:41:29,159 --> 00:41:31,000
please contact the police promptly.

